[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4544580709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4544580709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4544580709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDuDMZQ","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-26T13:40:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T13:40:26Z","body":"When `AnimationTree` is added to the node tree it calls `_setup_animation_player()` function:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/fa09dd17a68a5741cb2361f1d07af271c7a40c4f/scene/animation/animation_tree.cpp#L976-L985\n\nThis happens every time `AnimationTree` or its parent (or grandparent) is added to the node tree. The code in `_setup_animation_player()` matches to the error messages. So the options most likely are:\n1. `_setup_animation_player()` should consider the case that this isn't this `AnimationTree` instance's first ever addition to the node tree.\n2. `AnimationTree` should also handle exit tree notification and handle the clean up of signals and other stuff so that `_setup_animation_player()` can be safely called again.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4544580709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4554958198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4554958198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4554958198,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD38ldg","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T13:30:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T13:30:10Z","body":"I tested the latest 4.7 beta3 both in Linux and Windows and both the standard and .NET versions. It seems that the bug is only in Linux mono version.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4554958198/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4710070986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4710070986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4710070986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGL36yg","user":{"login":"DinoMC","id":9079110,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzkxMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9079110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC","html_url":"https://github.com/DinoMC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-15T16:30:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T16:31:29Z","body":"I have a similar issue and I believe this is caused by the same commit so I'll add this here. Basically, the engine isn't checking if a signal exist before trying to disconnect it:\n\nI have a scene that instantiate the same child scene (res://scenes/eye_enemy_area_2d.tscn) 30 times, directly in the Tree, not via code. This scene contains an animation player.\n\nWith 4.7 (**RC2**), I get a giant spam of errors in the log when I run the game: \n>ERROR: Attempt to disconnect a nonexistent connection from '(res://scenes/eye_enemy_area_2d.tscn::AnimationLibrary_dgi5k):<AnimationLibrary#-9223371995213724054>'. Signal: 'animation_added', callable: ''.\n   at: _disconnect (core/object/object.cpp:1643)\n>ERROR: Attempt to disconnect a nonexistent connection from '(res://scenes/eye_enemy_area_2d.tscn::AnimationLibrary_dgi5k):<AnimationLibrary#-9223371995213724054>'. Signal: 'animation_removed', callable: ''.\n   at: _disconnect (core/object/object.cpp:1643)\n\n(x30)\n\nFor me, this is on a **Linux ARM 64** release build, so it's not just Mono.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4710070986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4710089090","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4710089090","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4710089090,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGL5Bgg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_