_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-15T23:24:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T23:24:16Z","body":"Can confirm, still present in RC3 :(","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4713307308/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4723824051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4723824051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4723824051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGY_Vsw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T21:32:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T21:32:12Z","body":"CC @TokageItLab \n\nSounds like a race condition so a bit tricky to debug, but maybe the problematic code can be identified and patched easily.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4723824051/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4725208320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4725208320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4725208320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGaT1AA","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T01:57:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T03:35:27Z","body":"In 4.7, there have been several major refactorings in the Animation system, and it is not easy to tell which of those constitutes a problem, it is puzzling that this is an issue specific to Mono. Also, I don't recall changing anything around `_setup_animation_player()` during the refactoring. Could the changes related to multi-threading outside AnimationTree be having an effect?\n\nIt is immediately obvious that `animation_added/removed/renamed` lacks a guard by `is_connected()`, but since the `cache_cleared/animation_list_changed` signal already has the guard, I do not think fixing that is particularly relevant.\n\nMoreover, I don't have Linux or Mono in my environment, so it's difficult to identify the issue. Can anyone who is encountering this bug [bisect](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/feedback/bisecting.html) it?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4725208320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4730537449","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4730537449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4730537449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGfZF6Q","user":{"login":"DinoMC","id":9079110,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzkxMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9079110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC","html_url":"https://github.com/DinoMC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T13:10:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T15:54:42Z","body":"OK, I did some tests with releases first and I can tell you it did NOT happen up to Godot 4.7-dev5 and it started happening since Godot 4.7-beta1\n\nI'll try to set up compile to bisect\n(Edit: it works but compile is slooow on my linux instance. ~4 steps left)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4730537449/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4733078829","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4733078829","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4733078829,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGh0NLQ","user":{"login":"DinoMC","id":9079110,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzkxMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9079110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC","html_url":"https://github.com/DinoMC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T16:55:33Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T23:16:08Z","body":"huh... so:\n\n>Godot Engine v4.7.beta1.official.1c8cc9e7e\n\nThe bug is present\n\n>Godot Engine v4.7.dev5.official.a8643700c\n\nThe bug is absent\n\nBut here's the things, if I checkout 1c8cc9e7e and compile it myself, the bug is absent. How come?\n\nEdit with more info : \n- I'm compiling both the editor (on windows) and the release arm64 linux template (on linux), then I load my project and the export template in the windows editor, export the build to the linux server, and run it.\n- I'm on checkout 1c8cc9e7e2 on both sides\n- I use this to export the editor :  scons platform=windows target=editor arch=x86_64 d3d12=no -j8               (using visual studio community 2022)\n- I use this to export the template : /.local/bin/scons platform=linuxbsd target=template_release arch=arm64 -j2\n\nAny mistake ?\n\nEdit: Also tried this to be closer to the 'real' release build, but still now error:\n>~/.local/bin/scons platform=linuxbsd target=template_release arch=arm64 production=yes lto=none -j2","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4733078829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736361501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4736361501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4736361501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGk8kHQ","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T23:17:21Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T23:17:21Z","body":"I don't have idea. Could the compiler settings be different from the official build? Do you have any idea @bruvzg ?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736361501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4738190877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4738190877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4738190877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGmsOHQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T05:01:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T05:01:36Z","body":"It might be a compiler bug related to LTO (`production=yes` flag), if I remember correctly there were similar issue with 32-bit windows export templates built with particular GCC version.\n\nIf you want exactly same config as official releases, use [build containers](https://github.com/godotengine/build-containers) or at least the same toolchain (there's a list tools and versions in the container page README).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4738190877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4739693566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4739693566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4739693566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGoH7_g","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","rece