26-06-18T08:56:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T08:56:40Z","body":"I can reproduce it with local non-mono Linux build, will bisect a bit later.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4739944058/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4740244430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4740244430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4740244430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGopjzg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:21:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T09:34:11Z","body":"```\n9e43daa74d8b74fd8e7cb49b6d6b552fee0e7cfd is the first bad commit\ncommit 9e43daa74d8b74fd8e7cb49b6d6b552fee0e7cfd (HEAD)\nAuthor: Lukas Tenbrink <lukas.tenbrink@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sat Oct 25 21:50:31 2025 +0200\n\n    Change `new` overloads to use a tag instead of a pointer, which can lead to problems. Inline the `new` definition to save on a call.\n\n core/object/class_db.h |  3 ++-\n core/os/memory.cpp     | 22 ----------------------\n core/os/memory.h       | 30 +++++++++++++++++-------------\n 3 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)\n```\n\nBisected to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112035, cc @Ivorforce\n\nReproduced with Linux release template build (`target=template_release production=yes`, no other build flags used), using GCC 16.1.1 20260515 on Fedora 44.\n\n_Edit: Seems like issue is specificaly inlined `new` operators, probably a LTO related compiler bug._","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4740244430/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4741262956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119752#issuecomment-4741262956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119752","id":4741262956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGpnubA","user":{"login":"DinoMC","id":9079110,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzkxMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9079110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC","html_url":"https://github.com/DinoMC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DinoMC/events{/pri